<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>中序遍历 on Minghan的博客</title><link>https://Jiangmmh.github.io/tags/%E4%B8%AD%E5%BA%8F%E9%81%8D%E5%8E%86/</link><description>Recent content in 中序遍历 on Minghan的博客</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 16:17:04 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://Jiangmmh.github.io/tags/%E4%B8%AD%E5%BA%8F%E9%81%8D%E5%8E%86/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Leetecode 二叉树(三)</title><link>https://Jiangmmh.github.io/posts/leetecode-tree03/</link><pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 16:17:04 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://Jiangmmh.github.io/posts/leetecode-tree03/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="一有递有归">&lt;strong>一、有递有归&lt;/strong>&lt;/h1>
&lt;h2 id="49-把二叉搜索树转换为累加树">49. &lt;strong>把二叉搜索树转换为累加树&lt;/strong>&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>这道题目要求将BST右侧的节点之和加到当前节点。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>使用一个全局变量s记录当前和，按右-中-左的顺序遍历BST，将s加到当前节点中。&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-cpp" data-lang="cpp">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="k">class&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nc">Solution&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="k">public&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">:&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">TreeNode&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">convertBST&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">TreeNode&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">root&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">s&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">0&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="c1">// 返回子树之和
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">&lt;/span> &lt;span class="k">auto&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">dfs&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">&amp;amp;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">](&lt;/span>&lt;span class="k">auto&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">self&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">TreeNode&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">node&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">if&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">!&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">node&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">self&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">self&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">node&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">-&amp;gt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">right&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">s&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">+=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">node&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">-&amp;gt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">val&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">node&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">-&amp;gt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">val&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">self&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">self&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">node&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">-&amp;gt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">left&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">};&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">dfs&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">dfs&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">root&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">root&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">};&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="50-具有所有最深节点的最小子树">50. &lt;strong>具有所有最深节点的最小子树&lt;/strong>&lt;/h2>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>二叉树深度和高度的区别：&lt;strong>深度&lt;/strong>指从&lt;strong>根节点到某个节点的路径长度&lt;/strong>（边数），或节点层数（根为第1层时）。&lt;strong>高度&lt;/strong>指从&lt;strong>某个节点到其最远叶子节点的路径长度&lt;/strong>（边数）。&lt;/p>&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;p>这道题目的题目描述有点stupid，翻译一下：找最深节点的最近公共祖先（LCA）。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>我们可以使用DFS递归实现，在递的过程中记录当前层次的深度，并通过全局变量max_depth记录最大深度，在归的过程中如果发现左右子树的深度相同且等于全局最大深度，当前节点就是满足条件的子树。&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-cpp" data-lang="cpp">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="k">class&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nc">Solution&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="k">public&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">:&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">TreeNode&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">subtreeWithAllDeepest&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">TreeNode&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">root&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="c1">// 在递的过程中计算最大深度，在归的过程中找最深叶子的LCA
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">max_depth&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">-&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">TreeNode&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">ans&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="c1">// 返回左右子树中叶子的最大
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">&lt;/span> &lt;span class="k">auto&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">dfs&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">&amp;amp;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">](&lt;/span>&lt;span class="k">auto&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">self&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">TreeNode&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">node&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">depth&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">-&amp;gt;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">if&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">!&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">node&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="c1">// max_depth会记录全部叶子中的最大深度
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">max_depth&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">max&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">max_depth&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">depth&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">depth&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">l&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">self&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">self&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">node&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">-&amp;gt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">left&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">depth&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">+&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">r&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">self&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">self&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">node&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">-&amp;gt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">right&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">depth&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">+&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">if&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">l&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">==&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">r&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">l&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">==&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">max_depth&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">ans&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">node&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">max&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">l&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">r&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">};&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">dfs&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">dfs&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">root&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">0&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">ans&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">};&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="51-根到叶路径上的不足节点">51. &lt;strong>根到叶路径上的不足节点&lt;/strong>&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>思路：“递”计算路径和，“归”判断不足节点并删除&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>在“递”的过程中：不断用limit减去当前节点的值（等价于计算从根到叶子的路径和）。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>在“归”的过程中：
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>当遇到叶子时判断limit是否大于0，如果是表示当前路径和小于limit，是需要被删除的不足节点，返回nullptr；否则不需要被删除，返回当前节点。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>对于非叶子节点，如果只有其左右子树均被删除时才选择将其删除&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-cpp" data-lang="cpp">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="k">class&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nc">Solution&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="k">public&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">:&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">TreeNode&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">sufficientSubset&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">TreeNode&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">root&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">limit&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">if&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">!&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">root&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="k">nullptr&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">limit&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">-=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">root&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">-&amp;gt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">val&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">if&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">!&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">root&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">-&amp;gt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">left&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">!&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">root&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">-&amp;gt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">right&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">limit&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">&amp;gt;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">0&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">?&lt;/span> &lt;span class="k">nullptr&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">root&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">root&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">-&amp;gt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">left&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">sufficientSubset&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">root&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">-&amp;gt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">left&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">limit&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">root&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">-&amp;gt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">right&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">sufficientSubset&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">root&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">-&amp;gt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">right&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">limit&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="c1">// 只有左右子树均是不足节点才删除
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">&lt;/span> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">root&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">-&amp;gt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">left&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">||&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">root&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">-&amp;gt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">right&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">?&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nl">root&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="k">nullptr&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">};&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h1 id="二二叉树的直径">二、&lt;strong>二叉树的直径&lt;/strong>&lt;/h1>
&lt;h2 id="52-二叉树的直径">52. &lt;strong>二叉树的直径&lt;/strong>&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>思路：自底向上DFS遍历二叉树，先求出左右子树的最大高度，用两者之和（直径）更新ans，最后返回当前子树的最大高度，即左右子树高度较大者 + 1。&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>